abstract: "Interactive honesty-map sandbox for river-gauge-shipping-utac (P130): Rhine / Western-Europe low-water inland shipping impacts from Bedoya-Maya et al. 2024, Vinke et al. 2022 (cascade text note), Kaub 78 cm operational consensus, and IfW Kiel 2018 GDP note. Discrete documented values only — no continuous gauge-to-loss interpolation. Deliberately no UTAC/CREP/AFET bridge — see DISCLAIMER.md. GenesisAeon P130."
